  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">No More Plastics in Our Oceans!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to reduce plastic discharge into the oceans through strengthening global governance, encouraging private sector leadership and creating a global movement of plastic pollution free cities. WWF and partners will work for an overarching global regulatory framework; stimulate action by the major players in the private sector and at the local level through city governments. The initial focus is on key top polluting countries in SE Asia, with programme development work in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
